{"name":"Gym for confidence (gymmaxxing)","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":27,"casual":{"lead":["Gymmaxxing is gym training pursued to improve physique and, as proponents describe it, confidence. The payoff is more muscle, a leaner build and a stronger sense of mastery over your body.","The chain is regular resistance training, then more muscle and a leaner build, then better body satisfaction and confidence. Training effects on muscle are well established. Wikipedia reports that exercise has short- and long-term mood effects and may affect self-esteem, with the strongest evidence for depression, where a 2024 network meta-analysis of 218 trials found exercise comparable to psychotherapy and medication with limited confidence. No study specifically examines gym training as a confidence strategy in looksmaxxing."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["People follow a regular lifting programme several days a week, usually with progressive overload, and pair it with eating for muscle gain or fat loss. Physique changes typically take months to become visible, and many track photos and lifts to see progress."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["Injury risk exists with any training. Evidence on well-being outcomes is mixed, and some people develop an unhealthy fixation on size or leanness."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"GYMMAXXING GUIDE","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/gymmaxxing-guide.1673916/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251124052117/https://looksmax.org/threads/gymmaxxing-guide.1673916/"},{"title":"GYMMAXXING GUIDE","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/gymmaxxing-guide.1379162/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260304133932/https://looksmax.org/threads/gymmaxxing-guide.1379162/"},{"title":"Gymmaxxing ULTIMATE FULL NATURAL GUIDE","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/gymmaxxing-ultimate-full-natural-guid